    "title": "资金流水全部门店总收入≠单个门店总收入合计是什么原因？",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><strong>问题：资金流水全部门店总收入≠单个门店总收入合计是什么原因？</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/ce940631ef1316581ef5194e6bc3b5a1.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/fde1126c535c838d5441b562c5016d0a.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/a2d91df36aaa653acf029c548fa5016b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>解决方案：检查是否有做客户预存款，客户预存款产生的收入是统计到所有门店的，单个门店的收入合计是重复统计了预存款收入部分</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202601/379105d66d18cb814024182d5faa5670.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
